<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 13.93 bln ats in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 13.93 bln ats in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 13.93 billion schillings in two-week repos at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 11 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 11.33 billion schillings in two-week repos, filling nine percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
